    "prompt": "The society simulation as a living miniature village: seven places in a ring around the parish commons, in the observer window's clockwise order (granary at the top, market, well, hut, shrine, woods, field), connected by a ring path. Twelve villagers walk between the places following the moves recorded in the sim's journal, one recorded turn per second, each with a small gem over the head colored by the motive behind the action (fear, duty, hunger, thirst, kinship, promise). Late afternoon turns into a lantern-lit dusk while the camera cranes down from a high oblique view, tilt-shift like a model village."
